WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.167
Module 13 moves from PostgreSQL database objects into distributed analytical processing with Spark SQL.

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:13.562
The relational concepts remain familiar: tables, joins, filters, grouping, and reusable transformations.

00:00:13.562 --> 00:00:17.462
The new challenge is scale and distributed execution.

00:00:17.462 --> 00:00:23.702
Carry forward the interface and grain habits from this module because they remain important when data

00:00:23.702 --> 00:00:28.617
processing moves to a distributed engine.

00:00:28.617 --> 00:00:33.102
As you move forward, keep the reasoning habits from this module.

00:00:33.102 --> 00:00:39.092
The next topic will add new SQL tools, but it still depends on understanding grain, missing values,

00:00:39.092 --> 00:00:42.435
and the meaning of each transformation.
